+            "",
+            f"- Multi-start runner: `{MULTISTART_RUNNER}` (`SHA-256 {data['provenance']['multistart_runner_sha256']}`)",
+            "",
+            f"- Sealed dense evaluator: `SHA-256 {data['provenance']['sealed_batch_sha256']}`",
+            "",
+            f"- MARGIN_Q dense evaluator: `SHA-256 {data['provenance']['margin_batch_sha256']}`",
+            "",
+            f"- Rescore runner: `SHA-256 {data['provenance']['rescore_runner_sha256']}`",
+            "",
+            "The JSON contains all per-user endpoint deliveries, compact boundary/subslot transmissions, "
+            "record digests, binary64 parity evidence, numerator-specific selections, the frozen-capacity "
+            "selection rescore, cohort reconciliation, and the swap-audit rows.",
+            "",
