+            "",
+            "- No demand-capped 2-swap conclusion was reported. The predeclared subset remained start 0 "
+            "on `w1/s0` under both rules, but downstream swap results are unsafe once parity fails.",
+            "",
+            "- Partial working files created before the parallel gate surfaced the mismatch are excluded "
+            "from `rescored.json` and must not be treated as results.",
